    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5714" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφῐᾰχυῖα</span></b> , irreg. part., perh.
		for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφι-ϝᾰχυῖα</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάχω</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝιϝάχω</span>
			), <i>flying about and shrieking,</i> of a bird, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.316
			</span></i>; later <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφ-ιάχω</span> as
				pres., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα ἀμφῐάχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					819
				</span></i>
			: impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφί̄αχε λαός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					4.147
				</span></i>
			; trans., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοὴ ἀμφί̄αχεν ἄστυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.460
				</span></i>
			.</div>
